  "_comment": "Candidate models for the bake-off. Prices are USD per 1M tokens, read 2026-10-05 (see .claude/state/LLM_OPTIONS_2026-10-05.md); they are for cost estimates only. 'request' holds per-model request quirks and is UNVERIFIED for every non-Gemini entry until `node eval/run.js --smoke` has been run against it: a wrong parameter shows up there as a visible API error. Keys are read by name from the environment or .env.local; none are stored here.",
